# RHI Rules

- RHI must remain backend-agnostic.
- Do not expose DirectX-specific enums or structures.
- Abstract GPU resources through interfaces.
- Keep RHI interfaces minimal.
- Prefer explicit resource transitions.
- Resource state tracking should be centralized.
- Use backend-specific implementations internally only.
- Avoid leaking backend assumptions into higher layers.
- Keep RHI extensible for future Vulkan or Metal support.
- Favor clean abstraction boundaries.